"text": "**The gates:** - three probes over the diff from the base `b7f61dd0a`, HEAD when P4 wrote them:   - no manifest or lock change;   - blitz-dom changed by added lines alone;   - the 15 files holding a `Widget` implementation untouched (research §Graph impact's sweep); - the `--locked` workspace build; - dioxus-native-dom's unit tests; - the new target; - the companions that read the canvas, the reserved form and the stand's ids; - the pre-push gate (`fast`); - the `doc` leg. The chunk edits public doc comments, and `fast` runs no rustdoc."
},
{
"from": 222,
"to": 229,
"text": "**What is absent:** - There is no boot-path touchpoint: no binary's start changes. There is no smoke entry. - There is no live leg, and no headful self-verify harness in this project. - There is no `audit` leg: probe 1 holds every manifest and the lock unchanged. - There is no `stand-repeat`. The new target is no `stand_` file, and no stand code changes. - There is no `a11y` leg. The new check reads no accessibility tree (tests · decision/a11y-leg-membership). - The coverage leg is not run locally. CI's coverage job reads dioxus-native-dom's 83 % floor on the pushed tree, and   the CI read asserts green over it."
},
